    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>In this game\u00a0Strategy is the key to\u00a0Survival.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>You need a Grand Strategy to win this War game,</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>A RTS action game with an Cool, Open-World like Base Building feature.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your base to helping you to fight a war against Armies of Zombies, Aliens and a Plant-based intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normal RTS have just a simple\u00a0Strategy, but this has another layer of\u00a0Difficult, making plans for a\u00a0Grand Strategy, setting this\u00a0Singleplayer game apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You win a battle in one spot, but the enemies attack another spot, just like in a real war of Survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>These are the units under your command.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016100/extras/4873bd138e6addb72525f327d83596c9.avif?t=1748758302\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each War might might bring you closer to victory, but using the wrong\u00a0Strategy, and you might lose the War. You need a\u00a0Grand Strategy to win this RTS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using Base Building to protect your army, as you plan your next raid into the enemy area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the fighting begins, and your army rolls into Action, You alone have the Strategy to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>The Enemies:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zombies just attack, with no real Strategy. Their Base Building is simple, with little defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Plants, also lacks any\u00a0Strategy, but they are good at Base Building, and hard to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Aliens have a Grand Strategy, and advance base building, with strong Defenses..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>The map:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This RTS war game, has 30 maps; Some give you new weapons, others more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wrong Strategy will get you fighting in some lost desert, will the Zombies and Aliens kill of the large cities... draining you for money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016100/extras/c990a50317e13fa01537cde2142ea89c.avif?t=1748758302\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
